{"id":"8630ed136c8dde2d","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-dtm-finite-runs.md","title":"Finite Turing-Machine Run and Halting","display":"df-turing-machine-run — Finite Turing-Machine Run and Halting","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-dtm-finite-runs","aliases":["73-df-dtm-finite-runs","73-df-turing-machine-run"],"display":"df-turing-machine-run — Finite Turing-Machine Run and Halting","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","[[73-df-dtm-local-transition]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§8.2, print pp. 324–336; PDF pp. 346–358; local normalized interface unless explicitly BookTM","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§7.2–7.3 and §7.5, pp. 148–152, 159–166; local normalized model, not literal book tuple","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":8},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-dtm-finite-runs"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-dtm-finite-runs</span><span>73-df-turing-machine-run</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-machine-run — Finite Turing-Machine Run and Halting"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"51696a3513b66fda\" href=\"?note=51696a3513b66fda\" title=\"73-df-dtm-local-transition\">73-df-dtm-local-transition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§8.2, print pp. 324–336; PDF pp. 346–358; local normalized interface unless explicitly BookTM"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§7.2–7.3 and §7.5, pp. 148–152, 159–166; local normalized model, not literal book tuple"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"8"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (single-tape DTM)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\)</span> (configuration set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_M\">\\(\\to_M\\)</span> (one-step relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"51696a3513b66fda\" href=\"?note=51696a3513b66fda\" title=\"73-df-dtm-local-transition\">73-df-dtm-local-transition</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{Conf}_M}\">\\(\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{Conf}_M}\\)</span> (reflexive transitive closure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\">\\(C,C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\)</span>；有限步闭包与接受、拒绝、停机配置谓词均在此配置域内实例化。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}run}\\vdash\nR_M\\coloneqq\\{(C,C&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M^2:C\\to_M C&#39;\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}run}\\vdash\nR_M\\coloneqq\\{(C,C&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M^2:C\\to_M C&#39;\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}run}\\vdash\nC\\to_M^*C&#39;\\leftrightarrow\n(C,C&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{Conf}_M}(R_M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}run}\\vdash\nC\\to_M^*C&#39;\\leftrightarrow\n(C,C&#39;)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{Conf}_M}(R_M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Accepting}_M(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\\,\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(C=(q_{\\mathsf{acc}},T,h)\\land C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Accepting}_M(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\\,\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(C=(q_{\\mathsf{acc}},T,h)\\land C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Rejecting}_M(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\\,\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(C=(q_{\\mathsf{rej}},T,h)\\land C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\bigr),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Halting}_M(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Accepting}_M(C)\\lor\\operatorname{Rejecting}_M(C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Rejecting}_M(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\\,\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(C=(q_{\\mathsf{rej}},T,h)\\land C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\bigr),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Halting}_M(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Accepting}_M(C)\\lor\\operatorname{Rejecting}_M(C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Reachability is witnessed by a finite run. An infinite computation is represented by the absence of every reachable halting configuration, not by an undefined local transition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-local-transition","status":"resolved","id":"51696a3513b66fda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-local-transition]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-local-transition","status":"resolved","id":"51696a3513b66fda","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\to_M$ (one-step relation, see [[73-df-dtm-local-transition]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{Conf}_M}$ (reflexive transitive closure, see [[73-df-finite-path-closure]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conf}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{Conf}_M}","display":false},{"tex":"C,C'\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}run}\\vdash\nR_M\\coloneqq\\{(C,C')\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M^2:C\\to_M C'\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}run}\\vdash\nC\\to_M^*C'\\leftrightarrow\n(C,C')\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{Conf}_M}(R_M)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Accepting}_M(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\\,\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(C=(q_{\\mathsf{acc}},T,h)\\land C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}machine\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Rejecting}_M(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\\,\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(C=(q_{\\mathsf{rej}},T,h)\\land C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\bigr),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Halting}_M(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Accepting}_M(C)\\lor\\operatorname{Rejecting}_M(C)","display":true}],"bytes":2610,"backlinks":[{"id":"b9e8acd6d8438a5d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$C_M^{\\mathsf{init}},\\to_M^*,\\operatorname{Halting}_M$ (machine semantics, see [[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]] and [[73-df-dtm-finite-runs]])"},{"id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Conf}_M$ and $\\to_M^*$ (configurations and finite runs, see [[73-df-dtm-finite-runs]])"},{"id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Halting}_M$、$\\to_M^*$ 见 [[73-df-dtm-finite-runs]]；$C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}$ 见 [[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]；神谕配置、初态及闭包关系见 [[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]。"},{"id":"fd9e85296ed6a24d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"86e3771995bb6290","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-154","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-finite-runs|Finite Turing-Machine Run and Halting]]"},{"id":"f6a57904f836e3e9","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Accept},\\operatorname{Reject},C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}$ 见 [[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]；$\\operatorname{Halting},\\to_M^*$ 见 [[73-df-dtm-finite-runs]]；$\\operatorname{Halts}$ 见 [[73-df-binary-diagonal-halting]]；对 $M=(Q,\\mathbf2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})$，$Q,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank}$ 总是该机器的分量。"}],"outgoing":["25902d0bd75ea963","51696a3513b66fda"]}